Subject: [PATCH 2/6] The start order made again with the reservations' regions
 (#2873)

From the same commands' traces of the tree whose reservations are taken
together: three functions more of main.c's units.

Part of #2873.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NNmNQsSoUunkrTyxkuSxop
Signed-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>
